-- Executes programs, runs shell commands, and reads arguments and environment values.
public use "process" function run(command text) giving failable unsigned.
-- Executes a program directly. Each sequence item is passed as one argument.
public use "process" function execute(program text, arguments sequence of text) giving failable unsigned.
public use "process" function count giving unsigned.
public use "process" function argument(index unsigned) giving failable text.
public use "process" function environment(name text) giving failable text.
